    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n45692" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐφετ-ός</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ή</span>,
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">όν</span>, (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐφίεμαι</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>desirable</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">θεῖόν τι καὶ
			ἐ</span>. <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>Ph.</u>
				192a17
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				2.374d
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐφετόν, τό</span>, <i>object</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸ γνωστὸν ἐ. ἐστι τοῦ γναστικοῦ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Dam.
					<u>Pr.</u>
					27
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οἰκεῖον ἐ</span>. ib.<i><span class="en">
				12
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐφετο[ς]</span> perh. for <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐφ᾽ ἕτος,</span>
			
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπ᾽ ἔτος</span>
			, <i>this year's,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				IG
				5(2).433.7
			</span></i> (Megalon., <span class="entity">ii B.C.</span>); [
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τῷ πρὸ τοῦ ἐ] φ᾽ ἕτος ἐνιαυτῷ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>SIG</u>
					742.56
				</span></i>
			 (Ephesus, <span class="entity">i B.C.</span>).</div>
